==Rules==
{{StageRule|13thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*20 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*20 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*15 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Countess Koryessa]] spawns as the boss.
**12 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 5.33~8.67 seconds<sup>160f~260f</sup>.
**8 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage. [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Pink Nyanko Ranger]] and [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Ranger]] will have no trouble controlling all enemies here, additionally, [[Helmet Cat (Special Cat)|Yellow Nyanko Ranger]] can reliably tank them and provides Wave Immunity to your Nyanko Rangers via [[Yellow Strike (Combo)|his Cat Combo]]. Countess Koryessa stands no chance here as long as you bring [[Red Strike (Combo)|Red Strike]].

